{"name": "Planted!", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extreme gardening is a competitive sport now. You're welcome.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planted!</strong> Is a horticultural combat party game where gardens are arenas, plants become weapons, and the gap between \"tending your crops\" and \"launching them at your opponents\" is smaller than you'd think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/76bc1088a91cefb738898d0a28d2c5fc.poster.avif?t=1787834621\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/76bc1088a91cefb738898d0a28d2c5fc.webm?t=1787834621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/76bc1088a91cefb738898d0a28d2c5fc.mp4?t=1787834621\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Claim your patch, plant your crops, and stake your territory before your rivals do. Every seed you sow could be a decision play it safe with a steady harvest, or gamble on a high-risk, high-reward crop that could change everything... or just let your friends do all the hard work and steal their stuff too</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/634dd5caa78f16c654bdceaacfc5122a.poster.avif?t=1787834621\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/634dd5caa78f16c654bdceaacfc5122a.webm?t=1787834621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/634dd5caa78f16c654bdceaacfc5122a.mp4?t=1787834621\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><strong>GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fertilise strategically, grow colossal crops, and maximise your haul, but watch your back! That person you thought was your friend? They're <i>probably</i> eyeing your patch. The bigger the crop, the bigger the target on your back, so grow smart, grow fast, and never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/41da7c9047dc463b276c4901758bc540.poster.avif?t=1787834621\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/41da7c9047dc463b276c4901758bc540.webm?t=1787834621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/41da7c9047dc463b276c4901758bc540.mp4?t=1787834621\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch your produce, score your points... whilst detonate weed bombs, dodging spud turrets and all that other pure cultivated chaos that's ongoing. With 12 powerups at your disposal and mayhem around every corner, the garden is never as innocent as it looks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/f1fe7946b53f7dc48f42b5f13b1bc425.poster.avif?t=1787834621\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/f1fe7946b53f7dc48f42b5f13b1bc425.webm?t=1787834621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/extras/f1fe7946b53f7dc48f42b5f13b1bc425.mp4?t=1787834621\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 Players</strong> \u2014 Online, offline, split screen, bots and cross-play supported</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 Diverse Biomes</strong> \u2014 Each with unique twists, hazards and...CHAOS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>12 Powerups</strong> \u2014 Because apparently a garden isn't dangerous enough on its own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo Campaign</strong> \u2014 A handcrafted story mode for lone green thumbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Unlikely Cast\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Pick from a cast of 12 unlikely gardening rivals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Sow. Grow. Throw. Planted! is a chaotic 1-4 player combat game where gardens are arenas, plants are weapons, and grudges are settled one harvest at a time.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448000/227fa3eb0e6b161970d6c54292882ca379c75f0d/header.jpg?t=1787834621", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Multiplayer", "Party Game", "Funny", "Colorful", "Cute", "Co-op"], "developers": "Cloth Cat Games", "publishers": "Cloth Cat Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3448000", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "12 May 2026 - Request Access\n\n2 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/M5QnVDUttP8", "first_seen": 1778536800.0, "review_rank": 655}